  "instructions": [
    {
      "primary_message": "Preheat a skillet over medium-high heat.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "While the skillet heats up, wrap each hot dog with a slice of bacon. (If necessary, use toothpicks to secure bacon to the hot dog at each end.)\n\n",
      "secondary_message": "4 slice bacon"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Once the skillet is hot, add hot dogs and cook, turning occasionally, until bacon is crisp and hot dogs are warmed through, 5-7 minutes. Remove to a plate and loosely cover with aluminum foil to keep warm. (Reserve skillet with drippings for later use.)\n\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Meanwhile, wash, dry, trim, and seed bell pepper; slice lengthwise into thin strips. Place in a small bowl. \n\n",
      "secondary_message": "1 red bell pepper"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Peel, halve, and slice onion crosswise into thin half-moons. Add to the bowl with the bell pepper and set aside.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": "½ medium yellow onion"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Wash, dry, trim, and halve jalapeño peppers lengthwise; seed and remove ribs with a spoon to reduce spice level. Season the cut-side with salt. (Be careful with jalapeños; do not touch your eyes and ensure you wash your hands after handling or wear gloves while preparing.)\n\n",
      "secondary_message": "1 pinch salt"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Return skillet (with drippings) to medium-high heat. Add jalapeño peppers, cut-side down, and cook, turning halfway through, until charred, 2-3 minutes. Remove to the plate with the hot dogs and re-cover with foil. (Reserve skillet with drippings for the next step.)\n\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Add bell pepper and onion to the skillet, then season with salt and pepper. Cook, stirring occasionally, until lightly charred and fork-tender, 4-5 minutes. Remove from heat.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": "salt\n⅛ tsp black pepper"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Toast buns (if desired).\n\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Fill each bun with a bacon-wrapped hot dog, then top with bell peppers, onions, and jalapeño halves. Drizzle with mustard, mayo, and ketchup (if desired).\n\n",
      "secondary_message": "2 tbsp yellow mustard\n2 tbsp mayonnaise\n2 tbsp ketchup"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "To serve, arrange assembled hot dogs on a platter and enjoy!",
      "secondary_message": null
    }
  ],
